   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Securing Climate-Resilient Sustainable Land Management and Progress Towards Land Degradation Neutrality in the Federated States of MicronesiaThe proposed project aims to secure critical ecosystem services in the Federal States of Micronesia&#x2019;s (FSM) through climate-resilient sustainable land and coastal management contributing to Land Degradation Neutrality (LDN). The project will focus on integrated planning and delivery of measures to achieve Land Degradation Neutrality (LDN) through demonstrat</narrative>
